{"seq":2,"slug":"backend-service-structure","title":"后端服务结构与分层","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure","rating":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 后端服务结构与分层 简介\n\n如何把一个后端服务的代码结构好，是它能否长期可维护的关键。本 hub 面向构建中大型后端服务的工程师，从分层的根本目的（对抗关注点纠缠、用单向依赖把变化局部化）讲起，对比水平分层、六边形、整洁架构与轻量 DDD 等风格，落到按特性分包与 Go 工程布局等具体组织方式，最后讨论结构如何随复杂度渐进演化。贯穿全篇的主张是：依赖应指向稳定、复杂度应被证明而非被默认，结构始终服务于「让变化持续可控」。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layering-fundamentals","title":"Layering Fundamentals","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-layering","title":"为什么要分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals/why-layering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dependency-direction","title":"依赖方向与依赖倒置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals/dependency-direction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"layer-responsibilities","title":"各层的职责边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/layering-fundamentals/layer-responsibilities"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectural-styles","title":"Architectural Styles","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/architectural-styles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layered-vs-hexagonal","title":"分层架构与六边形架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/architectural-styles/layered-vs-hexagonal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-architecture","title":"整洁架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structure/architectural-styles/clean-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ddd-lite-in-practice","title":"轻量 DDD 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-service-structur